{"id":"db2aa7bbde16bc7f","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-measure4-measure-algebra.md","title":"ZFC Measure4 Measure Algebra","display":"df-zfc-measure4-measure-algebra — ZFC Measure4 Measure Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure4-measure-algebra","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure4-measure-algebra","58-df-zfc-measure7-measure-algebra"],"display":"df-zfc-measure4-measure-algebra — ZFC Measure4 Measure Algebra","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure4-measure-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure4-measure-algebra</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-measure-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure4-measure-algebra — ZFC Measure4 Measure Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb A\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb A\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4MeasureAlgebra}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MeasureAlgebra}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4MeasureAlgebra}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MeasureAlgebra}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}measure\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4MeasureAlgebra}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\mathbb A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathbb A=\\bigl\\{\\{B\\in\\Sigma:\\mu(((A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A)))=0\\}:A\\in\\Sigma\\bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}measure\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4MeasureAlgebra}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\mathbb A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathbb A=\\bigl\\{\\{B\\in\\Sigma:\\mu(((A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A)))=0\\}:A\\in\\Sigma\\bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}measure\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MeasureAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\mathbb B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4MeasureAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\mathbb B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}measure\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7MeasureAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\mathbb B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4MeasureAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\mathbb B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The measure7 measure-algebra variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca